ay","chinese":"今天我的背更痛了"}]},{"id":"worse:o:84a0bc560b12","label":"adj.","definitionZh":"更不高兴的","glossesEn":["more unhappy"],"examples":[{"english":"his death made me feel worse","chinese":"他的去世使我很难过"},{"english":"to be none the worse for it/the experience","chinese":"丝毫没有因此/因这件事心情更坏"}]},{"id":"worse:o:869304b9d501","label":"adj.","definitionZh":"更不合适的","glossesEn":["more inappropriate"],"examples":[{"english":"the decision couldn't have come at a worse time","chinese":"这个时候作决定是最不恰当的"}]},{"id":"worse:o:253f727966d1","label":"adv.","definitionZh":"更糟糕地","glossesEn":["more unfavourably"],"examples":[{"english":"the interview could not have gone worse","chinese":"那次面谈糟透了"},{"english":"to think worse of sb/sth","chinese":"对某人/某事物评价更低"},{"english":"this skirt fits worse than the other","chinese":"这条裙子比那条更不合身"}]},{"id":"worse:o:be7450945a52","label":"adv.","definitionZh":"更差地","glossesEn":["at lower level"],"examples":[{"english":"to do worse","chinese":"干得更差"},{"english":"he sings worse than you","chinese":"他唱得比你还差"},{"english":"she's doing/feeling worse today","chinese":"她今天情况/感觉更差"}]},{"id":"worse:o:fe5f6cf44634","label":"adv.","definitionZh":"更严重地","glossesEn":["more intensely or seriously"],"contexts":["cough","bleed"],"examples":[{"english":"it’s raining worse than ever","chinese":"雨下得比以往都大"},{"english":"to hurt worse than yesterday","chinese":"疼得比昨天还厉害"},{"english":"worse still, …","chinese":"更糟糕的是…"}]},{"id":"worse:o:b61173f5d881","label":"adv.","definitionZh":"更不合适地","glossesEn":["more inappropriately"],"contexts":["timed","placed"],"examples":[{"english":"he could hardly be worse suited for this job","chinese":"他最不适合做这项工作"}]},{"id":"worse:o:ef3cc33e2c13","label":"n.","definitionZh":"较差者；两本小说中较差的一本","glossesEn":["less desirable one"],"examples":[{"english":"the worse","chinese":"较差者"},{"english":"the worse of the two novels","chinese":"两本小说中较差的一本"}]},{"id":"worse:o:bdf7c3b7c850","label":"n.","definitionZh":"更糟的情况","glossesEn":["less desirable state"],"examples":[{